<title>UK: BOE allots 670 mln stg in repos, shortage 1.5 bln.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 670 mln stg in repos, shortage 1.5 bln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it allotted 670 million stg in 6.0 percent repos to April 3 and 4 after forecasting a money market shortage of 1.5 billion stg.</p>
</text>
